kly?p=1368234#post1368234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that better?</div> </div> </div> </div>How about<b></b>: <br /> <br /> Moments that made you think &quot;Well, that escalated quickly.&quot; ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:18:18-08:00","id":1368256,"title":"","content":"It's probably cheating to use examples when I was ST.<br /> <br /> So, from games I played...<br /> <br /> One session Ragara was a maid who fled when we discovered he/she was spying on us. A story later, after trying to track him/her through the Threshold, he returned to the Realm as a mile-long nuclear cancer dragon and devastated the land.<br /> <br /> One story we were trying to help locals overthrow the (entirely mortal) government of Coral. The next we were travelling through time to stop the Yozis re-writing history.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-16-2020, 05:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T06:50:48-08:00","id":1368295,"title":"","content":"The PCs of my seafaring game got hired as privateers to recover the Realm's tribute after it had been stolen by an Abyssal.<br /> <br /> \u200bEverything went pretty much as planned until the PCs returned to port with their swag; at that point, the group's Infernal's <i>insistence</i> on compounding lie upon <i>blatant</i> lie, coupled with his lack of foresight, resulted in the entire crew being detained and questioned, and eventually the Wyld Hunt being called. The Infernal escaped and proceeded to summon Octavian, make a deal with Makarios, and get all the other PCs revealed as Anathema when they tried to defend him.<br /> <br /> \u200bIn retrospect, I'm kinda glad his player dropped; I dunno if I could've handled any more derails.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 02-16-2020, 11:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}